{"id":"7944760e23c02c51","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-subtraction-function.md","title":"Primitive Recursive Truncated Subtraction","display":"df-subtraction-function — Primitive Recursive Truncated Subtraction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-subtraction-function","aliases":["57-df-subtraction-function"],"display":"df-subtraction-function — Primitive Recursive Truncated Subtraction","depends_on":["[[57-df-natural-number]]","[[57-df-zero-function]]","[[57-df-projection-function]]","[[57-df-composition-operator]]","[[57-df-primrec-operator]]","[[57-df-primitive-recursive]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-subtraction-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-subtraction-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-subtraction-function — Primitive Recursive Truncated Subtraction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"aa2f7d42f23bb3d7\" href=\"?note=aa2f7d42f23bb3d7\" title=\"57-df-natural-number\">57-df-natural-number</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"021aaad5524b9d03\" href=\"?note=021aaad5524b9d03\" title=\"57-df-zero-function\">57-df-zero-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"163597d7804b3604\" href=\"?note=163597d7804b3604\" title=\"57-df-projection-function\">57-df-projection-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7463e44f61370c84\" href=\"?note=7463e44f61370c84\" title=\"57-df-composition-operator\">57-df-composition-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"92ef5d19605886fd\" href=\"?note=92ef5d19605886fd\" title=\"57-df-primrec-operator\">57-df-primrec-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6198f000bea16af4\" href=\"?note=6198f000bea16af4\" title=\"57-df-primitive-recursive\">57-df-primitive-recursive</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\omega\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\omega\\)</span> 包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"aa2f7d42f23bb3d7\" href=\"?note=aa2f7d42f23bb3d7\" title=\"57-df-natural-number\">57-df-natural-number</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,n,x,y\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(a,n,x,y\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z,\\pi_i^k,\\mathrm{Comp},\\mathrm{PrimRec},\\mathrm{PR}_k\">\\(Z,\\pi_i^k,\\mathrm{Comp},\\mathrm{PrimRec},\\mathrm{PR}_k\\)</span> 分别取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"021aaad5524b9d03\" href=\"?note=021aaad5524b9d03\" title=\"57-df-zero-function\">57-df-zero-function</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"163597d7804b3604\" href=\"?note=163597d7804b3604\" title=\"57-df-projection-function\">57-df-projection-function</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"7463e44f61370c84\" href=\"?note=7463e44f61370c84\" title=\"57-df-composition-operator\">57-df-composition-operator</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"92ef5d19605886fd\" href=\"?note=92ef5d19605886fd\" title=\"57-df-primrec-operator\">57-df-primrec-operator</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"6198f000bea16af4\" href=\"?note=6198f000bea16af4\" title=\"57-df-primitive-recursive\">57-df-primitive-recursive</a>；原始递归参数位于最后，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> 保持一元。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r,\\operatorname{pred},\\operatorname{sub}\">\\(r,\\operatorname{pred},\\operatorname{sub}\\)</span> 由下式依次构造；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\mathbin{\\dot{-}} y\">\\(x\\mathbin{\\dot{-}} y\\)</span> 是所构造截断减法的中缀记号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nr&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PrimRec}(Z,\\pi_2^3),&amp;\nr(a,0)&amp;=0,&amp;r(a,n+1)&amp;=n,\\\\\n\\operatorname{pred}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Comp}(r;Z,\\pi_1^1),&amp;\n\\operatorname{pred}(0)&amp;=0,&amp;\\operatorname{pred}(n+1)&amp;=n,\\\\\n\\operatorname{sub}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PrimRec}\\bigl(\\pi_1^1,\n\\mathrm{Comp}(\\operatorname{pred};\\pi_3^3)\\bigr),&amp;\n\\operatorname{sub}(x,0)&amp;=x,&amp;\n\\operatorname{sub}(x,y+1)&amp;=\\operatorname{pred}(\\operatorname{sub}(x,y)),\\\\\nx\\mathbin{\\dot{-}} y&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{sub}(x,y).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nr&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PrimRec}(Z,\\pi_2^3),&amp;\nr(a,0)&amp;=0,&amp;r(a,n+1)&amp;=n,\\\\\n\\operatorname{pred}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Comp}(r;Z,\\pi_1^1),&amp;\n\\operatorname{pred}(0)&amp;=0,&amp;\\operatorname{pred}(n+1)&amp;=n,\\\\\n\\operatorname{sub}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PrimRec}\\bigl(\\pi_1^1,\n\\mathrm{Comp}(\\operatorname{pred};\\pi_3^3)\\bigr),&amp;\n\\operatorname{sub}(x,0)&amp;=x,&amp;\n\\operatorname{sub}(x,y+1)&amp;=\\operatorname{pred}(\\operatorname{sub}(x,y)),\\\\\nx\\mathbin{\\dot{-}} y&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{sub}(x,y).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"r,\\operatorname{sub}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{pred}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad\nr,\\operatorname{sub}\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2,\\quad\\operatorname{pred}\\in\\mathrm{PR}_1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[r,\\operatorname{sub}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{pred}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad\nr,\\operatorname{sub}\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2,\\quad\\operatorname{pred}\\in\\mathrm{PR}_1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sub}(x,y)=0\\longleftrightarrow x\\le y,\\qquad\ny\\le x\\longrightarrow\\operatorname{sub}(x,y)+y=x.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{sub}(x,y)=0\\longleftrightarrow x\\le y,\\qquad\ny\\le x\\longrightarrow\\operatorname{sub}(x,y)+y=x.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地补充定义。原始递归给出 r 与 sub 的存在唯一性，复合给出 pred；构造只使用原有正元函数，不增加零元基函数。对 y 归纳得到末行两项性质，所以它是通常的非负截断减法。此构造不调用 min 或 max。</p>\n<p>标准递推依据：<a href=\"https://www.andrew.cmu.edu/user/kk3n/recursionclass/chap2.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CMU《Primitive Recursion》§2.6.5–2.6.6</a>，印刷第 13 页／PDF 第 6 页；此处按本书递归参数在最后、一元零函数的接口适配，未据此声称核验本书原文。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-natural-number","status":"resolved","id":"aa2f7d42f23bb3d7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-natural-number]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-zero-function","status":"resolved","id":"021aaad5524b9d03","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-zero-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-projection-function","status":"resolved","id":"163597d7804b3604","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-projection-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-composition-operator","status":"resolved","id":"7463e44f61370c84","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-composition-operator]]","embed":false}