d","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$Z,\\pi_i^k,\\mathrm{Comp},\\mathrm{PrimRec},\\mathrm{PR}_k$ 分别取 [[57-df-zero-function]]、[[57-df-projection-function]]、[[57-df-composition-operator]]、[[57-df-primrec-operator]]、[[57-df-primitive-recursive]]；原始递归参数位于最后，$Z$ 保持一元。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"6198f000bea16af4","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$Z,\\pi_i^k,\\mathrm{Comp},\\mathrm{PrimRec},\\mathrm{PR}_k$ 分别取 [[57-df-zero-function]]、[[57-df-projection-function]]、[[57-df-composition-operator]]、[[57-df-primrec-operator]]、[[57-df-primitive-recursive]]；原始递归参数位于最后，$Z$ 保持一元。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"a,n,x,y\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"Z,\\pi_i^k,\\mathrm{Comp},\\mathrm{PrimRec},\\mathrm{PR}_k","display":false},{"tex":"Z","display":false},{"tex":"r,\\operatorname{pred},\\operatorname{sub}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\mathbin{\\dot{-}} y","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nr&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PrimRec}(Z,\\pi_2^3),&\nr(a,0)&=0,&r(a,n+1)&=n,\\\\\n\\operatorname{pred}&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Comp}(r;Z,\\pi_1^1),&\n\\operatorname{pred}(0)&=0,&\\operatorname{pred}(n+1)&=n,\\\\\n\\operatorname{sub}&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PrimRec}\\bigl(\\pi_1^1,\n\\mathrm{Comp}(\\operatorname{pred};\\pi_3^3)\\bigr),&\n\\operatorname{sub}(x,0)&=x,&\n\\operatorname{sub}(x,y+1)&=\\operatorname{pred}(\\operatorname{sub}(x,y)),\\\\\nx\\mathbin{\\dot{-}} y&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{sub}(x,y).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"r,\\operatorname{sub}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{pred}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N,\\qquad\nr,\\operatorname{sub}\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2,\\quad\\operatorname{pred}\\in\\mathrm{PR}_1.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{sub}(x,y)=0\\longleftrightarrow x\\le y,\\qquad\ny\\le x\\longrightarrow\\operatorname{sub}(